Hello everybody,

Which modems are supported well by ofono, in your experience?

We are currently evaluating modems, and we would like to know which =

modems cooperate well with ofono. We are interested in modems which =

support a GPRS/UMTS data connection, and voice calls and SMS messaging =

for some use cases; dual-SIM support would also be useful.

We are integrating the modems into our hardware, in various use cases in =

an automotive context, and we use modem modules with integrated RF =

support, so I'm not so much interested about USB sticks or PCI cards. =

But feel free to share your observations anyway!

Many thanks & greetings          August

